Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来 神奇水晶的神圣魔法…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries the sacred magic of the Divine Crystal…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直保佑着我们的世界和人民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…blessed our world and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不久，其权力的承诺 就给我们的土地带来了战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in time the promise of its power brought war to our lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯，一个由水晶魔力保护着的 拥有神奇魔法的和平国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis, a peaceful kingdom of great magic kept safe by the power of the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆 一个拥有强势军事力量的帝国…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Niflheim, a military empire of vast machinery…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭借它的魔击术变得日益强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…made strong by the might of its Magitek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,两国之间的战斗旷日持久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long has war raged between the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路西斯退出）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着时间的推移 尼夫海姆凭借其不可摧毁的魔力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the years passed, Niflheim marched on nearby nations…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,向邻国一步步挺进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…driven by its unsurpassed technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自我防御 路西斯建立起一座魔法城墙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To defend itself, Lucis raised a magical wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙的力量来自于水晶本身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the strength of which comes from the crystal itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,王都因索莫尼亚 路西斯的最后堡垒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insomnia alone, the crown city and last bastion of Lucian defense…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来免受尼夫海姆帝国的侵略{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…remained beyond Niflheim reach for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在不断升级的战事中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amid the escalating war…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯的王子诺克提斯 来到戴涅布莱国…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Prince Noctis of Lucis had come to Tenebrae…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他的病痛来寻求医治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to seek healing for a grievous injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与他的父王雷吉斯一行远道而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made the long journey together with his father, King Regis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后、哥哥，还有我 戴涅布莱国的皇室成员…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, brother, and I, the royalty of Tenebrae…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一同欢迎了他们的到访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had all welcomed their visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那时 战火在各个地方同时开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then that the fires came, everywhere and all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,转瞬之间 整个戴涅布莱国火光遍地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a mere instant, the whole of Tenebrae was ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.61,0:02:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉乌卡将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Glauca.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆帝国的进攻 是针对来访的路西斯皇室成员的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Niflheim attack was an attempt on the lives of the visiting Lucian royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克提斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noctis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 救救我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯国王！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Regis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,露娜弗雷亚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunafreya…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,露娜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那天起直到今天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From that day until this day…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱国 一直被尼夫海姆帝国的铁拳控制…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Tenebrae has been gripped in the iron fist of Niflheim…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣誓与路西斯为敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sworn enemy of Lucis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:41.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（十二年后…）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯组织了强大的军队 来抵御尼夫海姆帝国的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Regis assembles a force of mighty warriors to combat the imperial menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑 他们凭藉着本国魔法赋予的力量…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dubbed the Kingsglaive, they fight relentlessly against Niflheim…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,与尼夫海姆帝国军队英勇作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…empowered by the magic of their sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有分队 坚守城墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, move to secure the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们打进来 我们就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they break through, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么久 克劳？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the hold-up, Crowe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳！ 情况怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowe! Status?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快要到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要支援，东墙已经失守 皮尔纳，你能回复我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help. East wall's going down. Pelna, can you get to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯让我们这些难民干这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis isn't paying us refugees enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给我们这点儿钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算公平吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯 我欠你一条命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx, I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有其他所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们东侧需要支援 尼克斯，你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need support on the east flank. Nyx, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮尔纳，快撤退 和其他人会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelna, fall back and regroup with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心使用魔法 大英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy on the magic, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人都在等你回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got people waiting for you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我值得等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我大显身手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心后面，利波特斯 敌人更多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your back, Libertus. We got more incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚持不了多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't gonna last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有剑队队员撤退 重复，所有剑队队员撤退！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Glaives, fall back. Repeat, all Glaives fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release the daemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法打败魔鬼 我要求全体撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take down that daemon. I'm ordering a full retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着回来 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here alive. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.27,0:08:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hearth and home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有分队，撤回提取点 支援回程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, fall back to the extraction point. Support is inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯！ 我们必须离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx! We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克斯，这是命令！ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nyx! We have orders! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowe. We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最受不了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I ain't got the stomach for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you rather walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 就像是家乡的加拉哈峡谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Just like Galahd Canyon back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢彻 报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luche, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇室部队看来正在撤退 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The imperial forces look to be withdrawing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我又欠你的情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I owe you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.59,0:11:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把它放在你的标签上的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put it on your tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好休息吧 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just try and get some rest, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抵抗了撤退的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disobeyed a direct order to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了家园 是吗，长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hearth and home, right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我还有一口气 我就会谨遵命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I got strength in my body, I obey that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 尼克斯·乌尔里克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fool yourself, Nyx Ulric.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你有何种力量 都是来自于国王的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever strength you have is on loan from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他 你一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候你的处理安排吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Await details of your reassignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管敌人获得了胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite their victory all but assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次突然而且莫名其妙的撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sudden and inexplicable retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然置身于危险之中 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at risk nonetheless, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们什么时候会回击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot know when they will strike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 西门有消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, word from the West Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名自称是敌国使者的人 请求见您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man claiming to be an envoy of the empire requests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆的使者求见 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The envoy from Niflheim awaits without, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到您…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.41,0:13:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 路西斯人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well met, my dear Lucians.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆竟然如此毫无顾虑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Niflheim grown so bold…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,派他们的宰相亲自做使者？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that they send the chancellor himself as envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只身一人前来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And under no guard, at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,能被伟大的雷吉斯国王认出来 真是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an honor to be recognized by the great King Regis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且允许我站在大堂之上 做自我介绍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet permit me to stand on ceremony and introduce myself nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿登·伊祖尼亚 尼夫海姆的宰相…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ardyn Izunia, Chancellor of Niflheim…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意为您效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at your humble service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在最吉利的日子来拜访您…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I come to you on this…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了呈上和平协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…most auspicious of days to offer terms of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,您肯定猜到了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you no doubt surmised…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最近的作战方案 并不是有计谋的撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that recent maneuver of ours was no strategic retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请叫它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次邻国的示好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a gesture of imperial goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你一样 我们最大的希望就是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you, we wish nothing more…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这场豪无意义的战争画上句号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…than to bring a swift end to this senseless war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,果真如此吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们要求你们完全的顺服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we require but a singular compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了拯救你们的王都因索莫尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your grand Insomnia here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:15:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯必须割让所有的领土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis must forfeit all territories to Niflheim rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因索莫尼亚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insomnia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯王国皇冠上的明珠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewel in the crown of the Lucian kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我怎么能够忘记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How foolish of me to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件小事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is just one more trivial thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关于您的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It concerns your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯王国的王子诺克提斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fetching Prince Noctis of Lucis…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有戴涅布莱国的美丽公主 露娜弗雷亚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the fair Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要结为夫妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are to be wed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,您看起来很苦恼 尊敬的陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem vexed, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向您保证 公主一直以来都敬重您…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, the princess still holds you in the highest regard…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这十二年来一向如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as she has done all these 12 long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道有没有人告诉你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know if anyone's told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们从来不容忍 不服从命令的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we don't take kindly to insubordination around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己好好看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do yourself a favor, take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是百年和平的景象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what a hundred years of peace looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种和平仅仅靠着一堵墙维持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lasting peace made by the Wall and the Wall alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吧 我们不需要你们这些外来移民…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we don't need any of you immigrants…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,上蹿下跳 充英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…jumping around, playing war hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！ 今天一战不顺利吧，剑员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Rough day on the gate, huh, Glaive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋 是你害的我们被困在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jerk. It's your fault he got stuck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样欢迎大英雄可不好 - 你这一身装扮也不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not a very nice welcome for a big hero. - Not a very nice outfit for one, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样穿能突出我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it brings out my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面放了什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you put in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃起来就像是陆行鸟的大便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like a chocobo turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿可不是加拉哈 我们这儿的人都喜欢这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't Galahd. That's the way folks around here like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我真高兴看到你 情愿出卖我们的传统，只为多赚点钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. I'm glad to see you're willing to sell out our heritage for a few extra gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯 你感谢尼克斯的救命之恩了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Libertus. You thank Nyx for saving your life yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧，克劳 我和尼克斯谁跟谁呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Crowe. Nyx and I are too close for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮我，我帮他 一向如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helps me, I help him. That's the way it's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你从别的地方获得帮助了 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you got a little help from something else, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要所有可能的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need all I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了温暖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hearth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有家园 - 还有家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And home. - And home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯，新任看门人 新工作怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Nyx the Gatekeeper. How's the new post treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直棒极了 你们肯定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's amazing. You guys would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看大门真是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gate watch are real sweethearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 他们恨我们这些外来人胜过一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know they hate us outsiders more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们除了恨我们 没有事情做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bored they got nothing better to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊也没那么糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boredom's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少意味着和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means there's peace, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了了解无聊的感受 我愿意为加拉哈人民再战上百次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd fight a hundred more wars for Galahdans to know boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不要把命丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't go dying yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是欠你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠你很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑没有了英雄 该何去何从呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would the Glaive be without its hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喝酒的时候 你能不能别说这些？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not talk like this while we're drinking, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚把敌人打得落花流水 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just sent the Niffs running with tails between their legs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们并不是逃跑了 他们只是在耍我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't running from us. No, they were toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么扫兴，卢彻 我们都知道发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop being such a buzzkill, Luche. We all know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道他们派出了使者 来到堡垒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know they sent an envoy to the Citadel after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么？ 向我们投降吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for? To offer their surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更像是命令我们 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More like demand ours. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令？ 去他们的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demand? My ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议吗？ 好好想想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人已经把路西斯逼到了绝境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empire's got Lucis on its last legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正是发出命令的绝佳时机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the perfect time to make demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们输定了 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are losing this war, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯不能光靠王者之剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis cannot rely on the Kingsglaive alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受停战协议会是我们最好的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accepting the truce may be our best course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样说完全忘记了我们的新墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of matters beyond the New Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要新墙还在 我们就不需要什么停战协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no need of a truce here, so long as it stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使处境变得更糟 我们还有旧墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if our position worsens, we still have the Old Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是停战协议可以停止一切战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but this truce will end the fighting altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们肯妥协…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only we could compromise…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妥协是不明智的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromise is unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道尼夫海姆的真正动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know nothing of Niflheim's true intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 城墙远非坚不可摧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fool yourselves. The Walls are far from impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的选择所剩无几{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The paths left to us are few.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,新墙从王座上吸取力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The New Wall draws its power from the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果国家需要 我还可以再支撑它几年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am able to sustain it for some years yet, if the kingdom requires it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:20:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是敌国丞相说了一件事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the chancellor spoke one truth, if only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都老了 旧城墙也…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are old, and the Old Wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.75,0:20:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能以一只虚弱的手来指挥旧墙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot command the Old Wall with a weakened hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有力量再掀起反攻的战斗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nor do I have the strength to muster an offensive to turn the tide on this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请做出最后决定吧 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let the choice be made, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 母亲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么从来没有这样不走运过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you never lose your lunch like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都讲不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种古老的艺术 是皇室的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's this ancient art, secret of the royal family and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯！ 尼克斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus! Nyx!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都过来 瞧瞧这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, guys, you gotta see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的国会显得很忙碌…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were hectic in the capital today…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为路西斯政府宣布完全接受…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as the Lucian government announced full acceptance…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被某些人批评为单方面的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of what some are criticizing as the unilateral peace terms…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,由尼夫海姆宰相 伊祖尼亚提出的和平条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…proposed by Chancellor Izunia of Niflheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战协议规定 路西斯的所有领土…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signing of the truce will see power over all Lucian territories…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.13,0:21:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,将归尼夫海姆帝国统治 除了王都因索莫尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…transferred to the empire, with the sole exception of Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为交换，尼夫海姆保证 因索莫尼亚及其居民的安全…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, Niflheim guarantees the safety of Insomnia and its citizenry…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及停止一切敌对行为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as well as a cessation to all hostilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这场旷日持久的战争画上句号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bringing a decisive end to this long and bitter war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们参加的所有战斗 一切都是徒劳无功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that fighting we did. All for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,队员们 报告室集合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaives. Assemble in the briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:21:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王已经发言 你们也已经听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has spoken, and you have heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.63,0:22:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有城墙之外的领地 都将割让给尼夫海姆帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All lands beyond the Wall are to be relinquished to the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有幸存的领地吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will no regions be spared?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 但是你的家乡也在其中呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None. - But your home's out there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王为什么这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the king do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这样可以结束该死的战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it'll end this damn war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳 - 长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crowe. - Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.27,0:22:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备 你要潜入戴涅布莱国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to deploy. You're being sent to infiltrate Tenebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱国 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tenebrae, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务细节属于机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission details are classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.69,0:22:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十分钟后 到我的办公室接受任务…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to my office for briefing in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 尼克斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Nyx…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.28,0:22:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用再守城门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off the West Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被重新调回堡垒守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been reassigned to the castle guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你要说的吗 卢彻？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what you were talking about, Luche?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:22:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到长官说的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这又不是我们能决定的 - 我们不能决定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This wasn't our decision to make. - Not ours to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是我们的家园！ 我们的亲人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are our homes out there! Our people!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会就这样抛弃他们吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna go along and abandon them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不妥协…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't go along with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆帝国就会把 因索莫尼亚变成地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the empire will unleash all hell on Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们就把他们也扔进地狱！ - 别激动，别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll unleash it right back at them! - Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对他们来说 不值一提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're nothing to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小如鼠 躲在城墙后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rats, snuck in from beyond the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 他们会利用我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, they had a use for us…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们觉得我们可以使用魔法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when they realized we could work their magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们把我们 从那些老鼠当中挑出来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they handpicked us from all the other rats out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.25,0:23:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们蚕食他宝贵的皇室能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and just let us nibble away at his royal majesty's precious power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一旦战争结束…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as soon as this war's all over…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.13,0:23:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要回到下水道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's back to the sewers for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.30,0:23:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你也是 英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you too, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么想家，利波特斯 为什么不和尼克斯一起回去呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missing home so much, Libertus, why don't you and Nyx head on back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定尼夫海姆会张开双臂欢迎你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Niflheim will welcome you with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家乡也在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a home out there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你已经忘了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.83,0:24:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会袖手旁观的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let it end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说民众的情绪很好 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is said sentiment amongst the people is favorable, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.43,0:24:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都欢迎这样的和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most all will welcome this peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.89,0:24:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有亲耳听到他们的声音…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you yourself have not heard their voices…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.60,0:24:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能知道他们的真实想法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how can you claim to know their hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.77,0:24:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去戴涅布莱国的任务怎么办 陛下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the mission to Tenebrae, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.35,0:24:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的秘密行动是否明智？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is such clandestine action wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.81,0:24:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被发现 这只会激起尼夫海姆帝国的不满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If discovered, it will only serve to provoke the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.78,0:24:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在合约签署之前 尼夫海姆帝国一直是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empire remains our enemy until the treaty is signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.20,0:24:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们还在战争中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as we are at war…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.86,0:24:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下就坚持要领先一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…His Majesty intends to remain one step ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.37,0:24:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,发卡？ 我觉得你应该不喜欢这种东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hairpin? I didn't think you were into that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是给我的 是给公主的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for me. It's a gift for the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.72,0:25:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不要张扬 要保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But keep that quiet. Nobody's supposed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.97,0:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是叫我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.35,0:25:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your back out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.44,0:25:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢听 但是你就像一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're sick of hearing it, but you're like a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.36,0:25:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小妹妹 我知道，我都听烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little sister to you. Yeah, I am sick of hearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保证完完整整地回来 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure you come back in one piece, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不是一个完整的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the guy in two pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.97,0:25:48.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（戴涅布莱国的曾经属地）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.19,0:25:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,露娜弗雷亚公主 我把后门打开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Lunafreya, I have left the rear gate open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.06,0:26:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.15,0:26:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.95,0:26:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快一点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then go quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我没有允许过你离开这里 露娜弗雷亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not recall granting you permission to leave your quarters, Lunafreya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.04,0:26:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷夫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.80,0:26:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去路西斯之前 你不准再离开这个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to leave this room again until the journey to Lucis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.93,0:26:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.64,0:26:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.52,0:26:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is truly going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆帝国逼我和诺克提斯结婚 有什么用意？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cause does the empire have to see me wed to Noctis?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.81,0:26:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要和解 而你们的联姻就是橄榄枝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have offered a peace, and your marriage is the olive branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我相信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.61,0:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎你信不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you believe does not concern me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.95,0:26:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎的是 你偷偷溜出去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does concern me is you sneaking off…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你母亲的杀手 一些你自己编造的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to go tell our mother's killer about some plot you've dreamt up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.62,0:26:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你憎恨雷吉斯国王是不对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are wrong to hate King Regis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.71,0:27:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼夫海姆杀了母亲 不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niflheim killed Mother, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.67,0:27:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了母亲 让你成了他们的哈趴狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They murdered her and made you their lapdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.32,0:27:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.86,0:28:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等待停战的期待当中 喜悦的气氛已经风靡全城…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An air of jubilation has swept the city in anticipation of the coming armistice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.73,0:28:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在和平协议正式生效前 仅仅只剩三天时间了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With only three days remaining until the peace is officially signed into effect…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.28,0:28:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,居民们踊跃的走上街头 表示…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…throngs of citizens have taken to the streets to show…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.58,0:28:20.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路西斯退出） （尼夫海姆袭击加哈拉）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.96,0:28:24.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和平协定 三天后生效）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.46,0:28:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯需要你们 年轻的战士们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis needs your strength, young warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要你们这些外来移民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need any of you immigrants.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.63,0:28:29.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷吉斯国王强迫“王者之剑” 进入加哈拉废墟？）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.84,0:28:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你有何种能力 都是来自于国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever strength you have is on loan from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有他，你一无是处 - 尼克斯，救救母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are nothing without him. - Nyx, help Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.43,0:28:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟琳娜 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selena, get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.68,0:28:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆的外交官们一波波涌进城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the waves of imperial diplomats entering the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是公主？ 你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The princess? Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.27,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟随最后一些帝国来者们 进入了城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was amongst the last of the imperial contingent to enter the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.47,0:29:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去报告情况了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reporting to my post now though, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.43,0:29:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,新任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.23,0:29:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们要去接一位公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We've got a princess to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.36,0:29:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不错 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice ride, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.20,0:29:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是王子的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.57,0:29:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接他出了城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken him outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是要准备婚礼吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he have a wedding to plan, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再叫我“长官”了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the "sir" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王有自己的打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has a plan of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.25,0:29:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克提斯王子和露娜弗雷亚公主 要在城外很远处见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Noctis and Princess Lunafreya are to meet far from Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.34,0:29:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她来这儿干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.55,0:29:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,使局面更复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complicating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.34,0:30:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派克劳去找公主 并且把她护送出戴涅布莱国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sent Crowe to find the princess and escort her out of Tenebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在追查问题出在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still trying to figure out what went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.32,0:30:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你对战争的看法 那你怎么看这场和平呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I know what you think about this war, but what do you think about this peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.62,0:30:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃自己的家乡 你高兴吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happy giving up your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.96,0:30:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国王的决定 因为他重用了我，我欠他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the king's decision. I owe him for taking me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.34,0:30:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很幸运 加哈拉有很多人没有这么幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lucky. There are people in Galahd who weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.09,0:30:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.59,0:30:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.01,0:30:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有国王的魔法 你能怎么帮他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good will you be without the king's magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.23,0:30:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 总是想要拯救别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, always wanting to save somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.90,0:30:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了，听我说 你这样不能赢得战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Believe me. But it doesn't win wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.65,0:30:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是愿望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just wanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是关于我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.74,0:31:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯才是你需要担心的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus is the one you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.95,0:31:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果局势变糟 他肯定会回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll go back if things gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.91,0:31:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的还在后面呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.89,0:31:24.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西门 四公里 15号出口）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你要阻止的人是谁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea who you're stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.98,0:31:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开 或许明天你还能保住工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open this gate now, and maybe you'll have a job tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.03,0:31:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是国王的命令 - 你确定你想要挑起…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- King's orders. - Are you sure you want to risk…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,外交争端吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a diplomatic issue now, of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.70,0:31:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是露娜弗雷亚·诺克斯·芙尔累 公主的私人护卫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the personal escort of Lady Lunafreya Nox Fleuret…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.12,0:31:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱国前任公主…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…princess of the former Tenebrae and…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们国家广受爱戴的准新娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our kingdom's beloved bride-to-be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.79,0:31:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到主权管辖区 从现在开始，由我们一手接管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to sovereign jurisdiction. We'll take care of things from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不还意思，德劳托斯长官 - 送公主去往城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forgive me, Captain Drautos. - See Her Highness to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.51,0:32:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道你… 我不清楚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that you… I wasn't made aware of any…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.88,0:32:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起，多谢 - 不，你…我必须…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Thank you. - No, you… I must…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.10,0:32:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须… 我必须先跟我的上司解释清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must… No, I have to clear it with my superiors first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主殿下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.40,0:32:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱国的公主殿下 露娜弗雷亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Royal Highness, Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.83,0:32:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been a long time, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.79,0:32:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.71,0:32:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克提斯王子不在这儿 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Noctis isn't here, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.22,0:32:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，亲爱的公主 他不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my dear. He is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.06,0:32:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太老了 不能应战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am too old to fight this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.39,0:32:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择 只能接受帝国的要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice but to receive the empire and accept their treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.98,0:32:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便如此…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.61,0:33:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是希望婚礼可以在别的地方举行 安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I had hoped to hold the wedding elsewhere, somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派出一名剑队成员去找你 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent one of my Glaive to see you there, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.24,0:33:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以安派人护送你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can ready an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.37,0:33:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 去找我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, go to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.88,0:33:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.71,0:33:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我去哪儿 帝国都会跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever I go, the empire will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.84,0:33:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样只会将王子置于更危险的境地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would only place the prince in greater danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.43,0:33:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责是保护王子 帮助他完成他的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my duty to protect the prince and see his destiny fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.39,0:33:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二年的时间没有改变我的初衷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These 12 years have not changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.19,0:33:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的命运吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.94,0:33:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责就是我的命运 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My duty is my destiny, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.78,0:33:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好迎接一切了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm prepared to accept whatever may come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.30,0:34:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.96,0:34:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些领土很快都会变成帝国的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these lands will be imperial soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.09,0:34:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计那些尼夫海姆人开始发号施令时 局面会变好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reckon things will get better when them Niffs start calling the shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一点儿好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one damn bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.31,0:34:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管是谁掌权呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter who's calling the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.56,0:34:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们是从那面墙后面来的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as they're calling them from behind the Wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.64,0:34:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的情形就不会有好转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ain't nothing gonna change around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.19,0:34:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.65,0:34:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.99,0:34:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一只手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.74,0:34:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌这是一场欢乐的团聚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust the reunion was a happy one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.91,0:34:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来 她一直都是尼夫海姆的人质吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she been a hostage of Niflheim all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是和平的象征 我就知道这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a symbol of the peace. That's all I'm told.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.92,0:34:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.09,0:34:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来她的到访 目的远非如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like she's here for something much bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.21,0:34:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是保护她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your orders are to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要观察她，不要倾听她 更不要去思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to look, not to listen, not to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.60,0:34:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是德劳托斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drautos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.93,0:34:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 汇报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.56,0:35:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我让开路 里面是我的朋友，该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of my way. That's my friend you got in there, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.86,0:35:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，在检查结束之前 你不能进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you can't go in until the examination has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么检查？ 到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What examination? What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.11,0:35:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，放松点儿 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.66,0:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳一回来 这些混蛋就把她推进了这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These bastards rushed Crowe in there the moment she got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们不让我进去看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they won't let me in to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.21,0:35:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.45,0:36:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳的私人物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowe's personal effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.33,0:36:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着处理吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do with them as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.55,0:36:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底派她去执行什么任务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what kind of mission did you really send her on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.76,0:36:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一个剑队成员 会在执行普通的护送任务时送命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Glaive winds up dead on a standard escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战不会影响进行详尽的调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see the armistice does not interfere with a full investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.19,0:36:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一名优秀的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会白白送死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her death will not go unanswered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.86,0:36:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,造化弄人呀 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a life, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.58,0:36:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个孤儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was brought up an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.66,0:36:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她的村庄跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run out of her village.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.96,0:36:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得第一次见到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still remember the first time I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.09,0:36:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨瘦如柴的小家伙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrawny little thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.26,0:36:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身脏兮兮的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all covered in dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.89,0:36:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界没有一个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a friend in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那双眼睛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those eyes…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那双眼睛里有故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something about those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.32,0:37:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不应该就这样死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserved better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为此付出一切…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would've done anything to give it to…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.14,0:37:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.68,0:37:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳死的时候是一名剑队成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowe died a Glaive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.23,0:37:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以好好战斗 来纪念她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still honor her by fighting as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时候比我还蠢 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dumber than me sometimes, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.94,0:37:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯害死了克劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis killed Crowe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.66,0:38:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.87,0:38:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉国王 把弱者扔给饿狼是得不到和平的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the king there's no peace to be had from throwing the weak to the wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.84,0:38:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我要孤身作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fight my own fight from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.76,0:38:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.37,0:38:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个发卡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.71,0:38:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你不会喜欢这种东西的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you were into that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.79,0:38:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是给我的 是给公主的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for me. It's a gift for the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.85,0:39:10.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（签字仪式之夜）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.17,0:39:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一场盛大的欢迎仪式 雷吉斯国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A most grand reception, King Regis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.13,0:39:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,您荣耀了所有的尼夫海姆人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor all of Niflheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.30,0:39:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀是属于我们的 艾尔德卡普特国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the honor is ours, Emperor Aldercapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.43,0:39:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,您远道而来 大驾光临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ventured far to grace us with your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.60,0:39:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽微薄之力而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the very least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.81,0:39:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们两国而言 明天将会是历史性的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow will be an historic day for both our nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.23,0:39:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的因索莫尼亚真是一个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your Insomnia is truly a marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.40,0:40:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,相比之下 我本国的城市黯然无光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own cities pale in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷这次拜访能够满载而归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray we are able to take away much from this visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.00,0:40:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想今天我们没有正式认识一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid we were never properly introduced yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.01,0:40:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕您还要等一下，公主殿下 我正在执勤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it's going to have to wait, Your Highness. I'm on guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.97,0:40:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就更没有比这里更安全的地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then surely there's no safer place for me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.81,0:40:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能知道你的名字吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.40,0:40:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯 尼克斯·乌尔里克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx. Nyx Ulric.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.49,0:40:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一件事要问你 尼克斯·乌尔里克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something else I wish to ask you, Nyx Ulric.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.20,0:40:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯国王说 他派出了你们的一名队员去找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Regis said he sent one of your order to come find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.58,0:40:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要亲自谢谢他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to offer my thanks in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.87,0:40:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到哪儿才能找到这名英勇的士兵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where might I find this brave soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.26,0:41:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I did not…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.09,0:41:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 不必{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am so sorry. - Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.73,0:41:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.15,0:41:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was carrying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.19,0:41:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本是要给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.36,0:41:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.70,0:41:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.61,0:41:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定希望你能戴上它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would've wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.87,0:41:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直随身带着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will carry it with me always.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.66,0:41:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.82,0:42:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这种和平意味着什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what this peace means?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.07,0:42:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它意味着我们的家乡没了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means our homes are gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.58,0:42:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all of them…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.12,0:42:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.38,0:42:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说这儿有一些仇视和平协议的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard I could find some treaty haters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.96,0:42:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对地方了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come to the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.30,0:42:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.17,0:42:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家跟这个人打个招呼吧 他的职责是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone say hello to a man who spends his days…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.63,0:42:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在皇室里为伟大的国王效力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the loyal service of our good king.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.89,0:42:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,“曾经”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Spent."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.31,0:42:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些日子一去不复返了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.06,0:42:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够了那个混蛋的谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done listening to that bastard's lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.69,0:42:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许高居王座 但是他不是国王…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may sit on a throne, but he ain't no king…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不是我的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…least not of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.07,0:42:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如此说来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到反政府组织 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…welcome to the resistance, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.78,0:42:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你有话要说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're here to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.20,0:42:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.42,0:43:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.09,0:43:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论诺克提斯身在何处 保佑他的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wherever Noctis is, keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.01,0:43:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无他求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.88,0:43:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向哪个神祈祷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what god do you pray?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.26,0:43:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 命运的囚徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, the slave of fate and destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.47,0:43:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃你的祈祷吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.94,0:43:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,神不会听的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods do not listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.81,0:43:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉乌卡将军 你为什么会在这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Glauca. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.98,0:43:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么聪明 肯定不会相信这次和平谈判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are far too clever to have ever believed in this peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜你见不到你挚爱的诺克提斯 你还有别的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity you couldn't see your beloved Noctis. You have another purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.32,0:43:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来这儿不是为了尼夫海姆 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not here for Niflheim. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.20,0:43:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿是为了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.87,0:43:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.04,0:43:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.62,0:43:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你就会明白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come tomorrow, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:55.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（签字仪式当天）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.55,0:44:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆一行已经离开酒店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niflheim contingent has left the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.72,0:44:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有不到三个小时 仪式就要开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than three hours until the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.14,0:44:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强城堡守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolster the Citadel guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.98,0:44:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯 公主和你在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx, is the princess with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.94,0:44:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.11,0:44:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在守卫城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on duty at the Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.98,0:44:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些尼夫海姆人已经出发前往仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Niffs just left for the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.28,0:44:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有和他们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she wasn't with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.43,0:45:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 归航信标？ - 是的，现在发送坐标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A homing beacon? - Yeah, I'll send the coordinates now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.93,0:45:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能为我定位吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you pinpoint a location for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.56,0:45:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 但是听起来像是追着野鹅到处乱跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but it sounds like a wild-goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.98,0:45:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你有大把的时间 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you got some free time on your hands, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.89,0:45:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不管怎样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I do, for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.21,0:45:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些坐标都是在因索莫尼亚以南 二十英里的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those coordinates are about 20 miles south of Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.09,0:45:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,城墙之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.84,0:45:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳去这些地方干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was Crowe doing all the way out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.84,0:45:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不… 他们派她去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. They sent her to…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.97,0:46:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你再帮我一个忙 皮尔纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need another favor, Pelna.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.48,0:46:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雷达上把这些坐标都调出来 告诉我你发现了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull those coordinates up on the radar and let me know what you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.56,0:46:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 你觉得这事关重大吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it. You're thinking this is all a big deal now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.52,0:46:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不容忽视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, too big to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.78,0:46:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起，先生 - 嘿，嘿，嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, sir. Excuse me. - Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.07,0:46:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, wait a minute. - Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.79,0:46:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 这里不仅仅是城门守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up. This is not the gate watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.83,0:46:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是城市的核心 我们国王的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the heart of our city, the home of our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.96,0:46:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式不容中断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony must not be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.80,0:46:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要迅速地、悄悄地摆平一切威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neutralize any threat quickly and quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.55,0:46:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.13,0:46:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.64,0:47:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑队成员呼叫 你在吗，长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaive to command. Are you there, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.73,0:47:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急呼叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.23,0:47:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 德劳托斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Drautos.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.98,0:47:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,重大发现，尼克斯 在这个位置有一整队飞艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackpot, Nyx. There's a whole fleet of airships sitting at that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.28,0:47:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼夫海姆 - 是的，看起来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Niflheim. - Yup, and from the looks of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.45,0:47:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们在准备作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'd say they're headed to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.20,0:47:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 队长在哪儿？ - 应该在城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the captain? - Should be at the Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.70,0:47:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的呼叫器没有应答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no answer on his frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.16,0:47:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 现在肯定忙着护送任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, must have his hands full with the escort detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.58,0:47:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮尔纳，最后帮个忙 我需要你启动王者之剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelna, one last favor. I need you to prep the Glaive for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.29,0:47:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.62,0:47:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要不经队长许可 擅自行动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna deploy without the captain's order?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.54,0:47:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 动手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. Just get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我该怎么跟他们说…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what am I supposed to tell…?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.92,0:47:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 剑队队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, Glaive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.72,0:48:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式还有两个小时就要开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony is in less than two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.01,0:48:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须做好准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must make ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.43,0:48:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.39,0:48:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.77,0:48:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位王者之剑队员在此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of the Kingsglaive is here, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.77,0:48:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求见您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He demands an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.40,0:48:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,“要求”？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Demands"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.32,0:48:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 陛下，求您 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty, please. - Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.86,0:48:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下令启动王者之剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the order to deploy the Glaive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.57,0:48:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.08,0:48:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,城墙以南二十英里 尼夫海姆军队已经做好了进攻的准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Niflheim fleet makes ready for war 20 miles to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国的部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An imperial fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.00,0:48:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们挟持了公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.25,0:48:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉鲁斯 在签约室外增派守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarus, post guards outside the treaty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.50,0:48:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做将被视为对和平缺乏信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be seen as a lack of faith in the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.55,0:48:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该避免如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we all harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.63,0:48:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.76,0:48:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许还要 把艾尔德卡普特皇帝置于监禁之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may well have to take Emperor Aldercapt into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.47,0:48:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,监禁他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detain him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.18,0:48:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对等同于再次宣战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would go beyond a new declaration of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.64,0:48:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍处在战争状态，克拉鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are still at war, Clarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.31,0:48:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你，尼克斯·乌尔里克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Nyx Ulric.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.94,0:48:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑多快能够部署？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon can the Kingsglaive deploy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.40,0:49:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨候命令，随时都可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your word, at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.16,0:49:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.12,0:49:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出露娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.75,0:49:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是调虎离山呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this is a diversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.67,0:49:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.08,0:49:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱的公主在飞艇上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tenebrae's princess is onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.84,0:49:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有两件任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got two jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.43,0:49:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.35,0:49:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止尼夫海姆的飞艇 飞临因索莫尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stop those Niff ships from flying on Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.32,0:49:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分组行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.86,0:49:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准的渗透和拔除行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard infiltrate and extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.40,0:49:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯，你来指挥，我们听命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx, you command. We'll follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.83,0:49:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑并肩作战 无论有没有指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Glaive stands together, captain or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.50,0:49:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了温暖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.71,0:49:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And home!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.55,0:50:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离这项历史性的停战协议的签署 还有不到二十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are less than 20 minutes away from the signing of this historic treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.23,0:50:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到国王的命令展开部署{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I received word of the king's order to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.36,0:50:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付城里的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see to matters in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.95,0:50:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有你的任务 而且并不轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your mission, and it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.12,0:50:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标有两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The objective is two-fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.70,0:50:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救人质 阻止敌人的前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure the hostage, and stay the enemy advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.20,0:50:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.41,0:50:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位剑队成员已经因公主而牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Glaive already died for this princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.96,0:50:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆不会轻易把她交出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niflheim won't give her up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.85,0:50:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.66,0:51:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，尼克斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Nyx!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.42,0:51:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.06,0:51:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.32,0:51:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备进入甲板下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing to head below deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.03,0:51:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有命令，不要和敌人正面接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not engage the enemy until instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.86,0:51:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆祝仪式仍在进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ceremony is underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.45,0:51:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着看尼夫海姆要如何玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's wait and see how Niflheim plays this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.33,0:51:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑已经渗透进敌舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kingsglaive have infiltrated the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.54,0:52:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切按计划进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everything's going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.86,0:52:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔里克报告 六艘尼夫海姆飞艇正飞往因索莫尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulric reporting. Six Niflheim airships confirmed inbound for Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.91,0:52:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯，这不像是一支作战舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx, this doesn't feel like a war fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.98,0:53:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该是找到她了 这里有一扇有守卫的门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might've found her. I got a guarded door here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.11,0:53:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个尼夫海姆的甲兵看守 我该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Niff MTs. What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.74,0:53:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold position.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.83,0:53:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达指定地点 目标很有可能就在附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrived at destination. High possibility of target in the vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed to secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.75,0:53:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就必须动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to mean a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.30,0:53:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小点声 不要闹大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it quiet and keep it confined.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.05,0:53:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩尔纳，你可以接敌了 但是要小点声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelna, you're clear to engage. But keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.34,0:53:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.69,0:53:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我来迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.44,0:53:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些意料之外的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit of unforeseen trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.90,0:53:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不是什么大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing too vexing, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.11,0:53:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个小贼而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple theft, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.86,0:53:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,贼胆包天 居然偷到国王头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A daring thief, to steal from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.99,0:54:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许魔法城墙和城堡大门 也不能保证一切安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps magical walls and castle gates do not keep all things safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.83,0:54:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.83,0:54:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过不要紧 偷走的很快都要被归还{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no matter. That which was taken will soon be returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.84,0:54:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.92,0:54:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是王者中沉着的典范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a paragon of kingly composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.55,0:54:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我必须发问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.97,0:54:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何以如此确定呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.27,0:54:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这件东西并不仅仅是装饰品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this thing is no mere trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.23,0:54:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有自己的意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It possesses a will all its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.44,0:54:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以打破任何盗贼的束缚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to break any thief's grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.61,0:54:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来确实是一件不错的奖品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds a very fine prize indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.12,0:54:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的，不是现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.38,0:54:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的？ 你太客气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me? You shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.26,0:54:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标确认 她一切安好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target confirmed. She's unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.89,0:55:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下，剑队找到了公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Glaives have recovered the princess, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.02,0:55:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到那个贼了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you found your thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.53,0:55:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.07,0:55:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,被偷走的东西完好无损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was stolen remains intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.82,0:55:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大好的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joyous news.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.41,0:55:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我就放心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am relieved to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.79,0:55:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.70,0:55:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的帝国里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how heavy a sentence…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.16,0:55:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷窃将要面对怎样的刑罚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…does the crime of theft carry in your empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.38,0:55:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重的刑罚之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among the heaviest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.88,0:55:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although there is one…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.88,0:55:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.09,0:55:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里将要乱成一片了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are about to get ugly over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.51,0:55:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩尔纳，快离开 这是个圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelna, get out of there. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.43,0:55:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？ - 一条有趣的古老法律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - A curious old law…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.02,0:55:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在边疆地区仍然有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I still permit in the outlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.81,0:55:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果盗贼能逃脱追捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief who escapes his captor…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.86,0:55:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不必再为自己的罪行负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can no longer be held to account for his crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.03,0:55:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是对受害者的警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warning to the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.24,0:56:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要示弱 以免放松正义之手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never show weakness, lest you forgo the hand of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.74,0:56:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，尊敬的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, good king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.08,0:56:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.41,0:56:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,协议已经被呈在桌上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treaty is now on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.50,0:56:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个历史性时刻进入倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown begins to this historical moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.25,0:56:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是对正义之手的警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a warning to the hand of justice itself…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.97,0:56:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要松开握紧的拳头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…never to loose its grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.94,0:56:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一组，保护外围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit One, secure the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.98,0:56:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二组，原地守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit Two, stand your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.61,0:56:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩尔纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelna.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.36,0:56:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴涅布莱公主安全…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Tenebrae princess, safe and…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.48,0:57:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶 他们是冲着水晶来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crystal. They're after the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.36,0:57:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板下面出事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something going on below deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.16,0:57:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘飞艇飞不到因索莫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship's not going to make it to Insom…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.17,0:57:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.09,0:57:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.63,0:57:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因索莫尼亚正在遭受攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insomnia is under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.72,0:57:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁把你带来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who brought you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.01,0:57:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格拉乌卡将军 - 你是诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General Glauca. - You were bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.30,0:57:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到这里来 也是他们的计划的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us coming here was all part of their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.67,0:58:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标被营救 请求准许撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target secured. Request permission to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.80,0:58:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准许 去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted. Get to…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.41,0:58:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶是不会为你效劳的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crystal will not serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.87,0:58:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会为你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.08,0:58:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它带离这座被诅咒的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…once I take it from this accursed city.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.87,0:58:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来不是为了水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the crystal I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.96,0:59:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,城墙没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wall. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.17,0:59:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 这是个圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.60,0:59:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.53,0:59:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.91,0:59:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's got into you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.03,1:02:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，趁着还有机会快撤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, we must escape while we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.62,1:02:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，克拉鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Clarus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.58,1:02:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕逃跑这条路已经走不通了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear escape is no longer an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.76,1:02:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉乌卡将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Glauca.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.85,1:02:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能坚持住吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you make it up? Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.50,1:03:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢彻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luche!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.09,1:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.01,1:03:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.81,1:03:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇家学院教授驾驶吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They teach piloting back at the royal academy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.44,1:03:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.07,1:03:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友 我已经很久没有与你并肩战斗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a long time since I fought at your side, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.87,1:03:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.49,1:03:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次的战斗不是你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but this time it is not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.41,1:03:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想离开 现在就走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to leave, go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.29,1:03:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛下我的国王？ 绝不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And abandon my king? I think not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.71,1:03:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，我们的魔法都系与你一身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, our magic is bound to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.72,1:03:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你倒下，路西斯就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fall, Lucis falls.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.89,1:04:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我们再次战斗吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us once more into the fray…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.67,1:04:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须带我去见雷吉斯王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must take me back to King Regis.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.00,1:04:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？ 因索莫尼亚是战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind? Insomnia's a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.21,1:04:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个责任 不能忘记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a duty. I cannot neglect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.88,1:04:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊，这种话我早就听过了 - 那你应该知道，我们必须抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I heard all that before. - Then you know we must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.34,1:04:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧做什么？ 找死吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry to do what? Get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.39,1:04:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不害怕死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fear death.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.56,1:04:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无畏公主的举动就免了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with all this brave princess act.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.31,1:04:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是祈祷这东西能飞到目的地吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pray this thing will make the trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.59,1:05:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.80,1:05:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一切都在照计划进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I daresay everything has proceeded according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.64,1:05:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吗？ - 确实如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - So it has.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.73,1:05:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经破坏了城墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have broken the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.56,1:05:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下摧毁这座城市了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains is to break the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.07,1:05:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该走了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we take our leave, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.53,1:05:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要日落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun will soon set.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.78,1:05:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必在这里目击黑夜的恐怖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need not be here to witness the terrors of the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.38,1:05:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crystal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.47,1:06:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你飞得太快了 我们必须降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going too fast. We have to land.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.26,1:06:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得再容我一会儿 - 没有时间了，我自己去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna have to give me a minute. - There is no time. I will go on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.39,1:06:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服下面藏着翅膀吗？ 魔法是没用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got wings underneath that dress? You can't use magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.81,1:06:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一切奇迹都要靠魔法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all miracles are made by magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.86,1:06:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不害怕死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fear death.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.73,1:06:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所怕的是 什么也不做，因而失去一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I fear is doing nothing and losing everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.95,1:06:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.12,1:06:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下，这个奇迹靠的还是魔法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank magic for that miracle, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.19,1:06:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了清算的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reckoning is at hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.86,1:07:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,新时代的曙光就在眼前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn of a new age.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.82,1:07:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经拿到了水晶 你还想从我这拿走什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the crystal. What more would you take from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.51,1:07:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯之戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring of the Lucii.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.30,1:07:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我的母亲、我的国家 我与生俱来的权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my mother, my country, my birth-right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.47,1:07:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆是我唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niflheim was the only life left to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.73,1:07:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一切都是为了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all of that was for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.98,1:07:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枚戒指现在属于我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring belongs to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.91,1:07:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,侧耳听吧，古时的路西斯众王 我是雷夫斯·诺克斯·弗洛雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me, Lucian kings of old, for I am Ravus Nox Fleuret…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.00,1:07:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间唯我配得拥有你们的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and none is more worthy of your power than I.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.13,1:08:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.63,1:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么拒绝我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you refuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.74,1:08:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.85,1:08:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，从这出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.58,1:09:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里通往一条秘密通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This leads to a hidden passageway.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.87,1:09:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着通道走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.08,1:09:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开之后 前往艾尔提夏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you are away, make for Altissia.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.96,1:09:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克提斯在那里等着你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noctis awaits you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.08,1:09:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 陛下 - 你早知道这些事将要发生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - You knew this was coming…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.46,1:09:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，但只有这样 才能让他们的怒气转离诺克提斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But it was the only way to draw their wrath from Noctis.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.13,1:09:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的王吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the way of our king?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.51,1:09:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲路西斯众子来救他自己的命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice Lucian sons to save his own?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.89,1:09:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了救这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.10,1:09:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把露娜安全送到艾尔提夏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Luna safely to Altissia.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.85,1:09:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是国王向剑队发出的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not an order from a king to his Glaive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.65,1:09:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个男人向另一个男人的恳求 拜托，尼克斯·乌尔里克，保她安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a plea from one man to another. Please, Nyx Ulric, keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.32,1:09:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了所有人的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the future of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.15,1:09:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.95,1:09:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.87,1:10:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.33,1:10:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候把它交给别人保管了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time it passed to another's keeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.36,1:10:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，求你住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.70,1:10:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来 - 求你了，别离开我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back. - Please. Don't leave us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.58,1:10:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你的母亲与我有同样的企盼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your mother would wish the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.96,1:10:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你和诺克提斯幸福地生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you and Noctis live happily.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.67,1:10:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被囚禁这么多年 都因我的失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those years captive because I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.84,1:10:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次不会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.05,1:10:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧锁的大门再也不能捆绑你的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked doors will seal your fate no longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.09,1:10:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Regis…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.68,1:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的希望系于你的身上 尼克斯·乌尔里克…祝你成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hope goes with you now, Nyx Ulric. Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.22,1:11:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊，路西斯的王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the King of Lucis…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.85,1:11:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在宝贵的城墙后面 积累着平安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who hoarded tranquility within his precious walls.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.44,1:11:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的平安去哪了，陛下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your tranquility now, king?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.52,1:11:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的平安来了 靠的是钢铁的猛然落下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is your peace, by steel's swift descent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.59,1:12:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.23,1:12:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们必须快点离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We must get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.78,1:12:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你的国王的意愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is what your king wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.40,1:13:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,露娜弗雷亚带着戒指逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Lunafreya has escaped with the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.86,1:13:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.12,1:13:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能离开这座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not to leave the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.91,1:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乌尔里克呼叫指挥官，队长，回话 - 附近一架监控摄像头…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ulric to command. Come in, captain. - Footage of the perpetrators…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.87,1:13:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下了罪犯的影像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was captured by a nearby surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.04,1:13:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是六名嫌犯的图像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are images of the six suspects.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.92,1:13:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一人被确认为加拉哈难民 利波特斯·奥斯提姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One has been identified as Galahdian refugee, Libertus Ostium…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.21,1:13:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,前路西斯王者之剑成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a former member of the Lucian Kingsglaive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.64,1:13:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.68,1:13:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你 你没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, I got you. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.85,1:13:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.27,1:13:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.85,1:13:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.60,1:13:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're free now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.23,1:13:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自由了？ 你这是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're free? What do you mean, "We're free"?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.36,1:13:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国…有承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empire. They promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.07,1:14:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地区是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This district's ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.16,1:14:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们这些难民的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.82,1:14:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的新家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our new home.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.29,1:14:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帝国？你投靠了尼夫海姆？ - 给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The empire? You went in with Niflheim? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.37,1:14:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着它 与其他人会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Meet up with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.63,1:14:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们的革命英雄，兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the hero of our revolution, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.93,1:14:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.48,1:14:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙还不知道他被击中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy just doesn't know when he's beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.90,1:14:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会开车吗？ - 我可以试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you drive? - I can try.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.36,1:14:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.79,1:14:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次飞不回去了，英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No warping for you this time, hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.92,1:15:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把方向盘给我 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the wheel. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.80,1:15:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的魔法没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are without your magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.35,1:15:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也注意到了？ 一定是因为国王死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You noticed that, huh? It must have died with the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.39,1:15:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的城市搞得一团糟，剑队队员 我告诫过你，不要逞英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mess of my city, Glaive. I thought I told you not to go playing hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.15,1:15:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把飞艇交给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the ship to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.86,1:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有皇家的事情要办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you got a royal fare to see to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.78,1:16:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.44,1:16:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许并非所有的奇迹都是出于魔法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not all miracles are made by magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.28,1:16:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.93,1:17:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么 惹得这些家伙如此生气？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell did you do to piss these things off?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.14,1:17:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们追的不是我 而是戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me they're after. It's the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.06,1:17:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那枚戒指有什么特殊的？ 别告诉我未来就靠它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so special about this ring? Don't tell me the future's riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.68,1:17:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上这枚戒指的人 可以与路西斯人沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He who wears the ring communes with the Lucii…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.65,1:17:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并驾驭强大的力量 - 什么样的力量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and commands great power. - What kind of power?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.15,1:17:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁忌的力量 很久以前被封在这枚戒指中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A forbidden one. Sealed within the ring, long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.73,1:17:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧城墙 我以为那只是睡前故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Old Wall. I thought that was just a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.75,1:17:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以担保 那不是睡前故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you it is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.37,1:17:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但路西斯人只将这种力量 交与他们认为配得的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Lucii grant their power only to those they deem worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.67,1:17:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以刚才那个戴上戒指的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that guy who tried it on back there…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.96,1:17:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他们认为他不配{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I guess he wasn't deemed worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.38,1:17:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.47,1:17:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这十二年改变了雷夫斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These 12 years have changed Ravus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.85,1:17:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他痴迷于过去 迷失在对权力的贪欲中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is bound by the past, and lost in his lust for power.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.85,1:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是怎么找到我们的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did they find us?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.12,1:18:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的发卡被它们追踪 把它给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hairpin. They're tracking it. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.26,1:18:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾有一个小妹妹 它在帝国入侵时被害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a little sister once. She was killed when the empire came.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.22,1:18:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救不了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.89,1:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时的我 就像现在一样无助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was as helpless then as I am now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.44,1:18:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法让她看到自己向往的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't show her the future she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.28,1:18:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的力量 是无法被那些寻求它的人发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}True power is not something that is found by those who seek it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.37,1:18:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会找到配得上拥有它的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is something that comes to those who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.70,1:19:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妹妹也希望你能看到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister wanted you to see a future as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.04,1:19:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人对他们所爱的家人 都有同样的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone would wish the same for family they love.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.18,1:19:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不会放过任何机会的，是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't pull any punches, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.69,1:19:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.48,1:19:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？ 我重复一遍…我是德劳托斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? Repeat, this is Drautos.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.73,1:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听得见吗？ 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.36,1:19:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真会挑时候啊，队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your timing's impeccable, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.87,1:19:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真有路西斯人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Lucii are real…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.66,1:19:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确实不在乎 自己的城市被撕碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they sure don't seem to mind their city getting torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.50,1:19:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要重新归队 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're to rendezvous and regroup. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.09,1:19:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没那么容易，队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might not be so easy, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.97,1:19:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你还不知道 我的翅膀被剪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wings have been clipped, if you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.50,1:20:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔里克，你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulric. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.80,1:20:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没死 你是想问这个吗，长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dead, if that's what you mean, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.59,1:20:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快前往D区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for Section D as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.93,1:20:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让营救队准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have an evacuation team ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.72,1:20:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们不能在城门见面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suppose you could meet me at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.39,1:20:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实很想离开这座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd kind of like to get the hell out of this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.89,1:20:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国的军队控制了所有出口 没有能够冲出去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperials hold all exits. There's no way through.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.73,1:20:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在D区见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at Section D.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.15,1:20:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前切断一切无线电联络 你要保证到达那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut all radio contact until then. And make sure you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.36,1:20:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次亲密约会，长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a date, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.17,1:21:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有回头路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.71,1:21:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Status report.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.17,1:21:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔里克杀死了一些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulric killed some good men.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.34,1:21:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戒指呢？ - 还没拿到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the ring? - We don't have it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.89,1:21:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格拉乌卡 雷吉斯国王死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Glauca. King Regis is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.39,1:21:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指即将前往D区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring is on its way to Section D.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.06,1:21:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到戒指 实现我们的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must recover the ring to realize our goal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.77,1:21:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果乌尔里克或是公主出手阻止 那就干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ulric or the princess get in the way, take them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.77,1:21:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺回我们的温暖与家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reclaim our hearth and home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.23,1:21:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,“温暖与家园”？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hearth and home"?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.32,1:21:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,利波特斯，回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.61,1:21:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.45,1:21:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.66,1:21:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在回基地的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the way back to base now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.70,1:21:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你前往D区的交叉路口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to head to the junction in Section D.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.33,1:21:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将与另一组人会合 把那个地方打扫干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna join with another unit, make a clean sweep of the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.71,1:21:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离革命胜利只差一步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're one step away from realizing this revolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.50,1:21:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让普鲁维亚白白死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not let Pruvia's death be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.88,1:21:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着你，英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be waiting for you, hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.03,1:22:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我说“安全”以前不要动 - 明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move until I say it's safe, all right? - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.38,1:22:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔里克报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulric, reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.38,1:22:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把公主带来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.63,1:22:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她活的好好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.60,1:22:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.15,1:22:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真能打呀，尼克斯 这一点我承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got some fight in you, Nyx, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.61,1:23:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.03,1:23:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到 你身中一枚空尖弹头，居然还能动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you're still moving with that hollowpoint in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.41,1:23:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,空尖弹头撕裂克劳体内的时候 她只能惨叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Crowe could do was scream, when one tore her insides apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.46,1:23:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做？ - 因为王者之剑什么也不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why'd you do it? - Because the Kingsglaive is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.38,1:23:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,作一个老家伙的炮灰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old man's battle fodder…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.13,1:23:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了因索莫尼亚的战争而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…sent to die in Insomnia's war…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.05,1:23:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们的家园却在枷锁之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while our homes are bound and shackled.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.80,1:23:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼夫海姆夺去了你的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niflheim took your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.97,1:23:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺去了我们所有人的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took all our homes!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.85,1:23:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都不能改变这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing will ever change that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.06,1:23:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不够聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never were too smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.65,1:23:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以在帝国拥有崭新的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've had a new future with the empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.50,1:24:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无处可逃了，公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere to run, princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.88,1:24:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.09,1:24:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.91,1:24:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此多人 为了这样一件小东西而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many dead over so simple a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.99,1:24:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？为了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.71,1:24:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无尽的力量 像你这种人是无法驾驭的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untold power, beyond the control of someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.21,1:24:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.09,1:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.77,1:25:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.73,1:25:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 恶魔已经被释放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. The daemons are unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.36,1:25:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯沦陷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis is fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.11,1:25:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.45,1:26:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把自己的想法告诉那些国王吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan on giving those kings a piece of your mind, princess?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.87,1:26:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？你在这里还有未尽的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a destiny to take care of here, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.34,1:26:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，有没有人告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, didn't anyone tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.43,1:26:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是这里的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the hero around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.49,1:26:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现身吧，路西斯的众王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourselves, kings of Lucis.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.54,1:26:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呼求这个世界的未来，凡夫俗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call upon the wards of this world's future, mortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.87,1:26:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你贪恋我们的力量 就必须首先经受我们的审判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you come lusting for our power, you must first stand in our judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.00,1:26:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要旁观因索莫尼亚焚烧到几时？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will you do nothing whilst Insomnia burns?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.09,1:26:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,老的少的 无论你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old or new, or whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.55,1:26:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,筑起你们的城墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summon your Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.35,1:27:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能命令我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not command us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.10,1:27:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不是皇室血脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours is not even royal blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.44,1:27:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你们的城市 根本不是我们的职责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not fall to us to guard your city.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.69,1:27:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类是愚蠢的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man is a fool creature…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.32,1:27:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧抓住过去 对未来畏缩不前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clinging to his past and cowering from his future.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.53,1:27:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了已经逝去的日子而白费力气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasting his strength on bygone days.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.53,1:27:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又有什么未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what future are you wards of?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.45,1:27:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太短视了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So shortsighted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.95,1:27:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且被咒诅 永远不能超越其上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cursed never to rise above it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.50,1:27:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.79,1:27:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这个勇敢的灵魂准备做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen what this brave soul is prepared to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.29,1:27:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也想保护未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, too, seeks to safeguard the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.21,1:27:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.22,1:27:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，年轻的国王 我们将考量你的武士的价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, young king. We will weigh your warrior's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.26,1:27:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的恩惠并不廉价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our boon does not come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.14,1:27:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,代价是一条生命 他的、或是她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cost is a life. His or hers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.48,1:27:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.52,1:27:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的力量吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with your power.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.99,1:27:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为此而来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.45,1:28:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来告诉你们 你们不是王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only came to tell you, you are no kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.29,1:28:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的价值已经被考量 结论是不够格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your worth has been weighed and found wanting.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.37,1:28:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃烧吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.34,1:28:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将失去那宝贵的戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to lose your precious ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.84,1:28:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但拯救它还为时未晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not too late to save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.47,1:28:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用它交换生命吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to barter for your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.64,1:28:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.64,1:28:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命不算什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.27,1:28:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那些希望看到未来的人一个未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving a future to those who want to see it…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.32,1:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.07,1:28:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不害怕 即使那个未来已经注定灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not fear, even if that future is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.66,1:28:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这份感情并非虚假 那么也许你还有些价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that sentiment is not false, perhaps you are worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.29,1:28:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将授予你我们的光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will grant you our light.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.88,1:28:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要知道 太阳升起之后，它就将消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know it will set when the sun rises.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.34,1:28:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此付出的代价将是你的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the price for it will be your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.89,1:29:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可真会讨价还价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys drive a hard bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.52,1:29:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪签字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I sign?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.40,1:29:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我慢慢习惯吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.20,1:29:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyx…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.46,1:29:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不必{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.37,1:29:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.59,1:29:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我欠你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.21,1:29:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,换换也好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a change.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.96,1:29:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你再帮一个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need another favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.55,1:29:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是露娜弗雷亚·诺克斯·弗洛雷 我们的王子未来的新娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Lunafreya Nox Fleuret, our prince's beloved bride-to-be.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.93,1:29:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的手中掌握着这个世界的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she has the future of the world in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.02,1:29:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她的安全 带她离开因索莫尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her safe, get her out of Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.10,1:29:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了 你需要这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I almost forgot. You'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.44,1:29:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向诺克提斯王子致意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Prince Noctis my regards.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.03,1:30:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 利波特斯将照顾你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libertus will take care of you from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.32,1:30:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路平安，殿下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a safe journey, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.99,1:30:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么办？ - 你要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What will come of you? - What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.45,1:30:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵循众王的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following the kings' orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.21,1:30:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把戒指交给诺克提斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see the ring to Noctis.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.00,1:30:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来将会平安 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future will be safe. I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.51,1:30:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想靠拳头杀出城吗？ 留着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning on punching your way out of the city? Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.10,1:30:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我们扯平了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now we're even. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.31,1:30:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你回到加拉哈在算账{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll settle up once you're back in Galahd.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.90,1:30:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和其他所有人等着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and everyone else will be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.61,1:30:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on you…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.32,1:30:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.17,1:31:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 系好安全带，公主 - 我的命在你手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buckle up, princess. - My life is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.19,1:31:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯人的力量又回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the power of the Lucii returns.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.06,1:31:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你没有时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter. You are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.90,1:31:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你，我可以挤一些时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, I'll make some.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.77,1:31:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么希望？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you hope to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.65,1:32:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人对付整个帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man against an empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.73,1:32:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付众恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the daemons.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.82,1:32:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有城墙保护 你怎么拯救因索莫尼亚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you save Insomnia with no wall to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.37,1:32:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全错了 我不是为了拯救因索莫尼亚而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got it all wrong. I'm not fighting to save Insomnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.42,1:33:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是强大的旧城墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the might of the Old Wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.67,1:33:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议 真的不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marvelous. Truly marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.41,1:35:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.71,1:35:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西斯、尼夫海姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucis. Niflheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.17,1:35:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的不是为谁而战 而是为了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't who we fight for that matters, only what.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.75,1:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了家园而战 这才是我们的忠诚所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight for our homes. That is where our allegiance lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.34,1:36:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种景象难得一见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not something you see every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.02,1:36:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么可惜的浪费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, such a pitiable waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.48,1:36:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些漂亮的街道 变成丑陋的废墟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those beautiful city streets, all laid to unsightly ruin.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.45,1:37:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要返回尼夫海姆 - 这么快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will return to Niflheim. - So soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.58,1:37:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣水晶已经是我们的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crystal is ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.04,1:37:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这里的事弄完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish this…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.58,1:37:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让恶魔们随意处置吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and see the daemons disposed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.21,1:37:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨遵圣命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you command.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.42,1:37:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么可惜的浪费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a pitiable waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.19,1:37:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能为帝国卖命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you serve the empire?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.23,1:37:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都做了些什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything they did?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.69,1:37:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪他们 夺得别人的馈赠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fault them for taking what was given.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.32,1:37:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怪罪那些馈赠他们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fault the man who gave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.53,1:37:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个躲在城墙之后的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who cowered behind his wall…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.70,1:37:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛弃了我们 只为保住他的王位和儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and abandoned us to save his throne and his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.17,1:37:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把戒指给我 我们的家园将重获自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the ring, and our homes will be free again.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.34,1:37:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝承诺如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empire has promised it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.34,1:38:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个承诺上 我看不到什么未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see much of a future on the other side of that promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.43,1:38:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别作傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.14,1:38:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救你的朋友们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.22,1:38:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也让你死去的妹妹安息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give your dead sister peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.06,1:38:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你为什么而战？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you fight for if not that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.11,1:38:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了 前面很颠簸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. This could get bumpy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.29,1:39:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,德劳托斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drautos.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.25,1:39:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给，你来开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.18,1:39:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,油门踩到底！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floor it!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.19,1:39:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利波特斯！ - 踩住油门别放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Libertus! - Just keep your foot on the gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.47,1:40:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.43,1:40:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等着你，英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be waiting for you, hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.00,1:40:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那众王的力量怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of your kings' power now?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.80,1:40:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们交给你的重担 你根本担不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've given you a burden you cannot hope to bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.01,1:40:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.93,1:40:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅凭愿望 是无法赢得战争的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanting doesn't win wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.76,1:42:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我的家园的荣耀 我为了一位我所厌恶的国王四处攻杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the honor of my home, I fought and killed under a king I loathed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.43,1:42:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他仍然背弃了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still he betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.18,1:42:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背弃了我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He betrayed us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.39,1:42:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在为同样的东西而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought for the same thing. All of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.48,1:42:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对过去看得太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've looked too long on the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.44,1:42:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对未来完全无视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're blind to the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.78,1:42:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太容易被猜透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.24,1:42:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你不一样 我从历史中学习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike you, I learn from history.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.46,1:42:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是往事的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're a slave to the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.96,1:42:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人的往事是他的荣耀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's past is his pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.38,1:42:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.84,1:42:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣耀在于塑造未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pride is shaping the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.15,1:43:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我要亏欠他许多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I'm gonna owe him big.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.33,1:43:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.67,1:43:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.56,1:43:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉斯王为了未来 做了他该做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Regis did what he did for the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.77,1:43:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of him…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.52,1:43:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家园还有希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's still hope for our homes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.48,1:43:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.37,1:44:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样死去倒也不算太坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the worst way to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.29,1:44:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好统治吧，年轻的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule well, young king.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.81,1:44:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should move.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.27,1:44:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't safe here either.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.07,1:44:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.41,1:44:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心尼克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about Nyx.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.70,1:44:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会照顾好自己的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.00,1:44:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.67,1:44:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.63,1:44:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须分开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must part ways here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.39,1:44:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.39,1:45:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你这位大英雄为伴 我怎么能秘密前行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hardly travel in secrecy alongside so great a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.06,1:45:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要为尼克斯信守一个承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I, too, have a promise to keep to Nyx.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.31,1:45:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷你们俩很快会重逢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray you two see each other again soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.61,1:45:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.03,1:45:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.54,1:45:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，利波特斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Libertus.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.51,1:45:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，王后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.39,1:45:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时欢迎你们到加拉哈来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and the king are always welcome in Galahd.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.81,1:45:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和尼克斯会等着你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Nyx will be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.14,1:54:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有很长时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been some while.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.35,1:54:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得上一次看见露娜弗雷亚夫人 是在什么时候吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the last time you saw Lady Lunafreya?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.15,1:54:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概十二年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.82,1:54:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 在你八岁的时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make you 8?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.82,1:54:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们那时还是小孩子 - 希望她别抱太大希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were kids. - Hope she hasn't gotten her hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.45,1:55:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不？ 你要镇静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.41,1:55:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到她时 你别太激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and keep it together when you meet her.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.53,1:55:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她想见到一位得体的年轻王子 - 你以为我不知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She'll expect to see a fine, young prince. - Tell me something I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.49,1:55:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有时间扯这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for all that.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.91,1:55:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们谈论的是你的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is your wedding we're talking about, Noc.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.75,1:55:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句也算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.75,1:55:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的需要冷静一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really gotta calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.88,1:55:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,“啊哦”是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Uh-oh"?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.47,1:55:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know.
